note Struct put: value and index are both bad (the value adds past the maximum, the index is past the field).
note omc traps 3 (exit 103): the index is checked before the value is computed.
struct H v uint 4 end
fn big to uint
ret 4294967295
end
fn five to ulong
ret 4
end
fn main to int
h = new H 1
put h v five add big 1
ret 0
end
